  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2207dd848eec35fc7907f95b438b61f6218a01c8c18d07889f62a29802559ed99dc8130935555c63f9d4cdd79862909e00848d9a3cb1f3372087d642b97f0fb4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6a61d96f3cd7a92b0cb619660c4ddf1b9862e092daceea0cd427c13d3c354bf55ec017c01d1de49ad2f2c56c53e5f0ae230056c72ccbad073afd0b91e0bd83ce48c98f0b07b3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/03f232aafa1ba90628f56c40d0f8d80609ceb66f1b09df2fae8c9004157d354128b432ec1f7dd199786bb16bcbd70d44bc62f85e941030ed1e9fe1329fa8fc5714c83e0af7c7b7eba484953e02e75914018366791f3e066247ab50f4b299273a13c4ba57955772898ead10ab7f31ce65d30b98280981a8b6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b81b4a022014c30104800b24700cff867d4fbac44dd45da6f61f2001183029acf0506d2972ae19d58577275c6583388aff8d66c22b0383796407ce0294dd10060288dcfcca017d5cd786163ce447d3375f9229814131c1b52d68936c9916ade0c571bd6aad562a556ff782763dd3e407c073f421101919f9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/67199a0451e6b4c0c0b20c7385c2b25af61cf23c58141cf8cdf376fc537ddf41a320b0e18bb7c15e1f58d2e4562f608161d1a3c80dcfedb40f9ce82c488deadcef7dbfe459318b8de64aa9853468b42ccc78d522ff25174dfdbd02fb2328cc551b7f92af56a098b579a82d4382ce48d1566a978d27549313\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bc13bf6dda719d8c52c28a82b1fb9a5404f455e4102f7f852f735c04a363011be291aacf04c6710cf3cef5d14c44d1c23a66ebbd992a58fa67428622bf8950ea6394ebd03e5a3424a76320cad8b95596c8d923b6b15e2778ce2b3a219f9c9b3a40912fad6e9a690427c328ea6292c5ef6988a74122c05351\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a7a63b88515a459c9b39940095ac5e9c86b21f379dba8815663610ac8adf6610c60ea2540b499d6b657d63ce6fd270e840ac770eee7cd6516fedf5714b898a7b436530a233ca7c548be7b07217c605120ecf479591be9e9cf0956723ae4e0177b2c7e383eb3d6918b5aa9c83c86c1bad9bc8a9da98ea8b72\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2ebc644bc3bc4b2b9c38ee1fc5936610956d8919f27ce49a4f9360d1b4b52ef49e1e5bfd3242cd03b9a5b139302e618baab985\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2d658bdb917e31794d2d8c1da7d69c5452c53c4f6f5156f1e017c0c92e3db3d31e572d090bf6f2653e5b1174710cbac5888c72d028b3c2324d71ed58f24be55696c945bcbb3759febc50a3eb8fbe5e419d100f5cdba59ed7e16ff987345b7a85706b94058810cb4ec367b4f10d912be1bd48df63597c4d0c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/489a593bbfde5a92321bc431e672c5b135ee8da268e02755c9b95bcd4400aaf66714f5317313517a67bd39e891da1c256a7dacb1e95f52a06eed91187cbb94fff38f25dde829f01d799b4e94b132033d403b6e94cb5709bf06ba01c4366f7492fed05b41eb9448a2801a649d3be8ce524862478849d31bda\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3a8bb79a938a500427d88b532d5283e4de891c6f50f52ee81216f064c4066d1a78bf9f15b39030fb3bf35570ec1b2dc0b84ffc5829d8317f1a810aae4326892e92b41df9314fa12fa84b9c8b0c4287a919fa182354de301a75ae69330c0c7eed2a0e52701d5e840327b9aba2aeba561683a90ae517afcc51\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3fa812d17dbf7b0fac956333f975db33af1752c99e3477940872c16015dede2225aa939778a601aa5e61bf3adac4d782f3d53d62c43140242195d515b1799c054d26c4e17836f337810451727d5a68325fd59ad6239e2eebfcbac49da11b30c97e0d7fa4afb2e451a00ab3542bb8879c561d29404e51abd5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4d49cdf0d2beffd724d762b0e5a3154a53ce1e298c35b49bee1c0f57523492f8d3df62603c9de1ab7d0c877ca5c9ae6378e0081253d290fe81ec2787b41d3e51fbb02352af3dc3fb1c162797e7623c7802d6a1baa685cf88ab53bdd32d52d08adb302c2afc17c5efcd82ecf1eb54999639de5c606f29ff3d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/cab348f79cabf979daa878a92eb2cf3724cefc763c5be0eca8b480d0b689cccd128d45810f2177338b5bac13cf78f094089c9163c3e2e48e98569cf0b39ac32be3fafe5badef116bc278b7f561d5c31a63c09e5c056f349c94d44ca53dad80d351f38c698bb803994ced823ae9c4d3acb21b181971f33979\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/85006267f9b39133ff1f6e088822b69315fbdd9ead107c4cbda0dd5cf0f3204da947f62c8fc56a5854a5e3da179bcc79c8e953293e5bfb6bcb8b9157985ba57c26c5fa62ea3dcd0f904a2d5d302f531f638b3f1f4a08a8df10011f9544c92e853b07e7ddf3c76b7113b13b819b4ccedc8939be3479c2dffa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/acdb13952fd3e89095f8990556ae71394416c5ba784ef8114b9d8b3e8b8fe9dca8e6d568d4a8068e6d5ae0b2c3dd6b39c0922fc55c5972152bd0e262e9dedc9d0bb4f73479200fb975df9c09935ce82c001386af39c9f5afbbdb36d17d3fae84222bfbdc15ee2cd12ed5db8e9d94c6187f75c497ca9bcd02\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b915cdbccb23bcba9aea2fe1b152f95cd4ffd6c8a17dc4d7cd4e23938f9e9b7aa55f04b67d8f23b747b09b15f2de0acd34a3977b88a525155dca5d06e31f857e426878a423dc6588ee49cceb0c3fbe5b6c7b5fde7d989a3ef17af86ba871e0eeefe2a30acbca51568f8d905a6ca7cd40a92f0b7dc39b4044\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8171ee5084a18e2db07707e3273cb3fb30d4d4e5ba8333592020f12cfa0cbf8ef300d695547d2ed3a5ecffb1ced8e0c4f434c425bc1401bf4f1c12f6131c7a4426e5dabcef5a1ddea9c52b63d4b0c926a659efb401c5f1c8d9a37a44530b61b38a43cbfa02e06dd0d1b23b5b172fc91da881d8e4b1e4e856\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b5bca2e9894fefe2f9e40b0a96c0b0987acc07ec314619171520c9bde1fa8a6a2020abe57b36c50877005c94ba5ca22d5ccd7c11c386a0d47af486f08cf3ae93af4bd9583fdfd026e33eb6e1f82edca25af5c8175acd37aa74cd81ec29332ba48be870946d59a99e27b53f68d4f9b62b4a85a894888ccd50\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dff3c9693d4a9029bc4bb651978d69868036a51a47e89a456622a5b55238aeea2789d939815e645f67b6abe13c64902d8f66b154139f75da5bd4dcb9f18b772e681be7af3455768b1ef8b9cafcd0553a9e7bda5f00067d2d2480d55fc3324eb007fbb51196ca2c11dac0f2337c2414e3fac1158920d10606\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/96131ac433a8c4713f2e141c64220031cc97e99264d12c65a70189f05313903279d5c9c54a30aca8a7ad0d37ef0c853c19121378aa8f9932e5ec3ee44cf26d921756b99deedeef58e0f07dcb130c07d245dd04ea9a32d31acfd5f97e01588438faa438d18dc05a0e1695edad0bbf63baa0d006ae8a9f6e3f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e2f0d5260c7388a5a99848d0e622badd296ad953d589dfedafed21c1db56972e04960d2c90d60dbdee557cfaea8efdc25876df57d15d297157af09aa35476689bb0498e47a7e76b5c3c4d097960eb34de84ed4fe093fdb3f4a09af3e015155066bcd5a1e69ee74949bccb96ede898b031d01998bf30be490\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/86e905fe2a87e25d492038bbe3bc82ae3ac8ba07059b73f97b29452001a9f7ca107a3cb37e9d6f6d961d8017950bcb75a1eaea8d4396186f01f8b8b5a5b0b8606a9066d81508f29fd4a790ed341a20715e20d016c508f91b066a224b6a41b5ba36f7cc44a12c3fa50c5fa683cc83bc2899c747456cabc5a1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d0c778c15559cb2b3b030190e0c456a5e1a1acb12b4ba3b12bf6aaf73b79b95d130104a03638004a34d9fe40ce65818d1c33dbc88ec19524a49fb4ae5b640ac6b0dc0a7f5eace51b9d8916866600dea4901d35ffef06766964c68514a3cf908be9520bded1b4b2ec1bf2f9fdbf98525d7d012d5890cb4b37\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b21893c2204e4c76f81def19d95c02b8d08e9c469ef9eda2fb47c5c614bedeb768b29828e5311e6590e670235defa52c74df87b27d4bab2df9d1e6e2c6a57643c6d624d96fa5b326a2521357ffcea8a5a70425a2ceccdf9c5cf34c145f806270f8d8233bd438c1427643e04034f304d116f54e1e0c7a2327\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1d90751649c30b297920317e0930374cff595536866b792e291ce9f981009673e4383a17139e6463ac9c19e7ae7de1bb49a4f5d13e4b7d1975bb4ec56d8b12991676d2b331c2f0455f9b60461a694debd6f72c7bf9f71a84d362b3d600a733e2d1fb2f352c144768c83c316c9351a5df217f577cba62c025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a0fd4df4262401a5d993a13fe27b590fcea93a985243eb903145f9e7d50ccdcb02f425df01ab076e008da275ee63e82b0532c91bb2346c4f1a5f2e1ebaf2ca68b5ab8d504ac3e88cea0439ed5c06114b4450cae8dd681f2b3fc55f9dc59ed8c4c903d0346efb8195a17ad89168d9fbdaa38e917286a3f2d6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3e7cb62948fcf60c876eacc3c39fec55b35d5a4e396ea6b8e38ea0a0f776668763417698e1a49d044354a97fc04051d3bbdff524057261b8bd0d30510d8681f02483adb7279f343b0eac0c615e7554f2394ccd9383ad526ea08eb8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/39f6ca8b80eeddc16e8c85bac6a07aaa9518b19fc33092bfdadaef3267952d51e88e19a890a69b17152785272d2f1c8a2c265b21fbbbbf47183f3b61642a7725b220a4bacf66322cfc2f03cdf3354923384310885067ad68be8e1745d3a975d7f2497c5108fe10f689bf42b63950c288e37173c198051d86\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/54cf65f89d3277d875e3c705d65dc982636c05a419a7876b630724b7d170ace314e83c4e8e6fde9e97f9f8adcb005ae02b274fe78eb3d3414ef4b695e22d40e4975014462d6087b0c32059eaf71a6f372a3bc1f694b9de5e3f787c2c7b1137989ee1fda94529c9296ee0421b4b866ddd8a6d18d7ec646da3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/187d6ada916505fa554241bec7f2d9134261dca6441ff10261ded6d9b66db657d34220b1438c5602e28f11c5daccb0dd8ef32af495f86c1ce2dbba759171222ef8a7d83f1df0a98bb279289e1b448117b08580ed400175abd6b0c3a1431ba7daf7f7e63af9fc89da420231db6770fe8213a3fab1ac555783\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5f0605e46bfb7645cc4a9a882d668a9eec2b63812f8e24f1e68706bd2c960fcbcdecba7632142f1a4336f36c769ba6ceb9435999704032975797a00652621b2334e4a70a8cb586c3e378f02b5c4beb6cd449091df3693285aaced4958b6bc9da4210ec4818edaf17fc98a864a9b64ba31f0e02b8a0d8e268\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/15a7cfacc88349430a1ad07ffcfe4ebf384e0e579c486460544d2291ec1f634e8659b563d426e0cf710efa61cc26e1ce62c3debfde6f21898aff86ed776e5f8e51ef810af50f5947a7014c98206fa8e58df0499697e9b80ba93ad3a8d6d0fb9c76faeaad9f466dff6be9f637c79e69b4b097cc4a7f36659b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8027f4b87f52743421567a75c6d5bfb29e65afd00281fa5aefdd132bd602e97592b0958697b8045ea99cf376d7c5ac1e7217033a83aa8fb9059e19bdb5f6338164b6c5433c86282a7ca23040b573c65bc12a7306ba2ab432bd60d983347839c6bb536a3c87694ecf39e02207da801fe048de4aa9fb7586bb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f8386b134e65f470da972b06e4e1b6ce474505d8f226ec594c40c5767938ec9eb426b843652b8e6e3400c5c33eeae567c166481c692fbca88dd9cbd4a9af14bcf46ee04da4847be23e7b3df0974bdb5ed82de8bb4d4de630e0c1561057b256d46fdcc46241b714503fc8916f8b9dfc6a72acd47238f9649b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
